+        dualLC γ e a b * R a * (structureConstant P M γ μ e (2 * Q γ - a - 2 / γ) b : ℂ)) :
+    R ef * (A ef af bf * (structureConstant P M γ μ (2 * Q γ - ef - 2 / γ - δ) af bf : ℂ)) =
+      dualLC γ ef af bf * R af * (structureConstant P M γ μ ef (2 * Q γ - af - 2 / γ) bf : ℂ) := by
